Special Abilities:
Lay On Hands (Su) 10 times per day as a standart action (Swift action if it's used on herself) Slyvia can heal allies for 4d6(4d8 if it's someone else then her) hit points or damage any undead for 4d6 points via a touch attack by expanding one use of this ability. Her lay on hands removes the shakened status from her allies, removes one negative score effect and grant them 'Sanctuary', forcing any enemy that make an attack roll against her allies first exceed a DC 18 will save to bypass it.
Smite Evil (Su) 3 times per day as a swift action, Slyvia chooses an enemy with the 'Evil' alligment to smite. She applies her charisma modifier (+4) to her attack rolls and her paladin level (+8) to her damage rolls. In addition, she also gains her charisma modifier (+4) as a deflection bonus to her ac against the smited creature.
Aura Of Courage (Su) Whenever an ally is close by (10ft. range), they gain a +4 morale bonus to all saving throws against fear effects. This aura only affects her allies and is only active whilst she is conscious&nbsp;&nbsp;
Aura Of Resolve (Su) Whenever an ally is close by (10ft. range), they gain a +4 morale bonus to all saving throws against charm effects. This aura only affects her allies and is only active whilst she is conscious&nbsp;&nbsp;
Channel Positive Energy (Su) By using 2 Lay On Hands charges, Slyvia can channel her healing outwards. Changing her healing from targeting single indiviuals to effecting anyone close by (30 ft. ranging from her)
Divine Bond (Sp) 8 minutes per day, Slyvia can call upon a angelic light from her god which projects itself as a divine halo. Any ally close by (20 ft. range) gains +4 to deflection armor bonus and +4 to saving throws against evil creatures. This halo also acts like a 'Contiunal Flame' spell, lighting the way forward as if she was a light source.&nbsp;
